e National Geodetic Vertical Datum should not be confused with mean sea level. See North American Vertical Datum of 1988 (NAVD 88). NGVD 29 should not be used as Mean Sea Level. NGVD 29 is no longer supported by NGS.", "value": 294.96}]}, "horizontal": {"value": []}, "notes": {"value": []}}, "inundation": {"enabled": false, "url": "", "zeroDatum": null, "downloads": null, "siteSpecificInfo": "", "dataAttribution": []}, "upstreamLid": "", "downstreamLid": "", "inService": {"enabled": true, "message": ""}, "lowThreshold": null, "forecastReliability": "Forecasts are not available. Only observed stages are available for this point.", "TruncateObs": "-1", "TruncateFcst": "2", "ObservedFloodCategory": "not_defined", "ForecastFloodCategory": "fcst_not_current"}